OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with clear intervals overnight.
OL,7,FA light breeze, with coastal showers
OL,8,Fbut drier inland. Feeling cooler than
OL,9,Fon previous nights, with a frost
OL,10,Fpossible in rural areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA clear and still start to the
OL,13,Fday, clouding over throughout the
OL,14,Fmorning with perhaps a few showers
OL,15,Fdeveloping by the evening.
OL,16,FTemperatures around normal for the
OL,17,Ftime of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
